          "findings": [
            "coordinate_transform.py:22-34 __init__ coerces coord_names->tuple, dims=tuple(dim_size) so DIM ORDER is dim_size insertion order; dtype default np.float64 (33). Implication: subclass must build dim_size in axis order; consumers derive shape from it.",
