            "indexing.py:2147 _dims=dims or transform.dims; 2154-2155 shape=tuple(transform.dim_size.values()); 2161-2163 get_duck_array=generate_coords(dims=self._dims)[coord_name]. Implication: forward must return dict containing every coord_name and broadcastable to input grid shape; np.asarray applied to values.",
            "indexing.py:2169-2173 _oindex_get meshgrids array_indexer in self._dims order and calls forward; 2186-2195 _vindex_get passes 1-D positions; 2214-2216 transpose reorders _dims but NOT dim_size, so shape (2155) stays in original dim_size order while _dims is permuted. Implication: forward must broadcast to the shape implied by the passed dim_positions, not assume self.dims order."
